================================================================================
1. DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"Software" means the ALICE-SDF Unity/Unreal plugins, editor tools, and
streaming components covered by this license.

"Game" means an interactive entertainment application distributed to end users,
where the Software is used as a component for rendering or content creation.

"Infrastructure Service" means any service that:
  (a) Provides the Software's functionality to third parties as a service
      (SaaS, PaaS, IaaS), or
  (b) Uses the Software to operate a multi-user platform with more than
      10,000 monthly active users, or
  (c) Generates more than $1,000,000 USD annual revenue from services
      that incorporate the Software.

"Affiliate" means any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is
controlled by, or is under common control with another entity, where "control"
means ownership of more than 50% of the voting interests or the power to direct
management and policies.

"Large Enterprise" means a legal entity whose consolidated annual gross
revenue, counted together with all of its Affiliates and across all lines of
business (not only games), exceeded USD 1,000,000 (or the equivalent in local
currency at the average exchange rate of that fiscal year) in its most recently
completed fiscal year. An entity becomes a Large Enterprise from the first day
of the fiscal year following the fiscal year in which the threshold was
exceeded.

