2. GRANT OF RIGHTS - FREE USE
================================================================================

You are granted a free, perpetual, worldwide, non-exclusive license to use,
copy, modify, and distribute the Software for the following purposes:

  (a) PERSONAL USE - Learning, experimentation, and non-commercial projects.

  (b) SMALL-SCALE GAME DEVELOPMENT - Creating and selling games, regardless
      of the revenue of an individual game, provided the developer is not a
      Large Enterprise and the game is sold as a standalone product.

  (c) GAME DEVELOPMENT BY ENTITIES THAT ARE NOT LARGE ENTERPRISES -
      Commercial game development and publishing for games distributed to end
      users, provided the developer is not a Large Enterprise.

  (d) EDUCATIONAL USE - Teaching, research, and academic projects.

  (e) OPEN SOURCE PROJECTS - Incorporating into open source projects,
      provided this license is included.

================================================================================
3. COMMERCIAL LICENSE REQUIRED
================================================================================

A separate commercial license is REQUIRED for:

  (a) INFRASTRUCTURE SERVICES - Operating the Software as part of a
      cloud service, metaverse platform, or streaming infrastructure
      that serves third parties.

  (b) COMPETING PRODUCTS - Creating a product or service that directly
      competes with ALICE-SDF's core functionality.

  (c) WHITE-LABEL SERVICES - Reselling or rebranding the Software as
      part of a commercial platform offering.

  (d) LARGE ENTERPRISE COMMERCIAL USE - Use of the Software by a Large
      Enterprise (including through its Affiliates) in commercial game
      development, publishing or other commercial products. Use of the
      Software by a Large Enterprise to create or distribute a VRChat world
      or other interactive experience requires a commercial licence, whether
      or not that world or experience is sold.

To obtain a commercial license, contact: https://extoria.co.jp/en

